        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Thirukkalachery, Tharangambadi, Nagapattinam District, Tamil Nadu, India\n- People: M.K.M. Aboobakar\n- Roles: Islamic writer\n\nFacts:\n- Thirukkalachery is a small village in Tharangambadi Taluk in Nagapattinam District, Tamil Nadu, India.\n- Tharangambadi, formerly called Tranquebar, is a town in Nagapattinam District in the Indian state of Tamil Nadu.\n- M.K.M. Aboobakar was born on 30 April 1937 in Thirukkalachery, Nagapattinam District, Tamil Nadu, India.\n- M.K.M. Aboobakar, whose full name is Menamuna Kassim Mohamed Aboobakar, is an Islamic Indian writer.",
